{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And its top in the heavens.</b> Very high, as in ״great and fortified cities in the heavens (בשמים),״ for there are instances where שמים serves as a term for air, as in ״that flies in the heavens (בשמים),״ and in Mishnaic language: ״from the earth to the heavens of the roof (שמי קורה).״" "<b>And let us make for ourselves a name.</b> A strong fortress forever, so that we rule over all creatures and reign over them." "<b>Lest we be scattered.</b> Through wars that those far away would wage against us if we do not build for ourselves a city and a tower; and if we are scattered, we would have no name. But now all the inhabitants of the world would make known to us the height of the tower, for everyone would speak of it. And they sought to negate what HaShem decreed — ״and fill the earth״ — therefore ״He scattered them over the face of all the earth״ by His decree."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:52.158417655Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}